WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.590
This one is training.

00:01.590 --> 00:04.530
First, get the session out to families.

00:04.530 --> 00:07.470
Go to Train, then Plan, then This week.

00:07.970 --> 00:10.920
Pick the week, check the session, then tap Publish.

00:10.920 --> 00:13.760
That posts it to families with a Can you make it?

00:13.760 --> 00:16.360
yes or no, and it always sends a phone alert.

00:16.860 --> 00:21.950
If anyone has not answered, go to Comms, Hub, and tap Send attendance reminder.

00:22.460 --> 00:25.870
Families can say no and give a reason if they want to.

00:25.870 --> 00:26.950
It is not a must.

00:26.950 --> 00:32.200
Their answers show live on your Today page, with the reasons kept for coaches only.

00:32.700 --> 00:35.300
On the night, open Train, then Run.

00:35.300 --> 00:40.640
Tonight shows the session, and Animations and Board help you explain it.

00:41.140 --> 00:43.120
After training, tap Attendance.

00:43.120 --> 00:45.360
Tap who was there and who did well.

00:45.360 --> 00:47.780
Anyone not ticked is logged as missed,

00:47.780 --> 00:51.490
and it all adds to their training attendance in the stats.

00:51.990 --> 00:57.170
To give a lad a session, a clip or a role guide, go to Train, Library.

00:57.170 --> 00:59.170
Tap Send to player profile.

00:59.670 --> 01:05.130
Pick the player, or tick whole squad, add a short note if you like, and press Send.

01:05.130 --> 01:07.500
It goes on their profile in the app.

01:07.500 --> 01:11.640
There is no WhatsApp or direct messaging to players, by design.
